OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA few
OL,6,Fshowers are possible this evening but
OL,7,Fmany places remaining dry with some
OL,8,Flate sunshine. Staying dry for most
OL,9,Fovernight but a continuing chance of a
OL,10,Ffew showers. Mild for many but turning
OL,11,Frather fresh inland in the countryside.
OL,12,
OL,13,CSaturday:FA few passing showers are
OL,14,Fpossible during the morning, mainly in
OL,15,FCumbria. Otherwise a dry day with a
OL,16,Fmixture of cloud and sunny spells.
OL,17,FFeeling warm but breezy in places.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
